flowchart TB
    Q[User query]

    Q --> AN[Trained query analyzer<br/>DistilBERT / DeBERTa multitask]
    AN --> OUT1["needs_retrieval<br/>temporal_class<br/>confidence"]

    OUT1 --> TRIV{needs_retrieval = 0<br/>AND trivial query?}
    TRIV -->|yes| G0[Generator<br/>no docs]
    G0 --> R0[Answer + meta<br/>no retrieval]

    TRIV -->|no| POL[Policy router]

    POL --> M{retrieve_mode}
    M -->|current| P1[current path]
    M -->|historical| P2[historical path]
    M -->|semantic| P3[semantic path<br/>soft timeless / low conf / timeless]

    subgraph RET["Temporal retriever each path"]
        FAISS[BGE embed + FAISS<br/>candidate_k neighbors]
        CE[Cross-encoder rerank<br/>ms-marco-MiniLM]
        FAISS --> CE
        CE --> BR{mode}
        BR -->|current| RR[Temporal rerank<br/>recency + alpha blend]
        BR -->|historical| AW[Adaptive date window<br/>expand until enough docs<br/>+ alpha blend]
        BR -->|semantic| SEM[Semantic rerank<br/>alpha blend]
    end

    P1 --> RET
    P2 --> RET
    P3 --> RET

    RR --> SUF
    AW --> SUF
    SEM --> SUF

    SUF[Evidence sufficiency judge]
    SUF -->|sufficient or max rounds| GEN[Generator<br/>extractive or API chain]
    SUF -->|insufficient| REP["Repairs:<br/>widen_window, expand_candidates<br/>raise_topk, relax_to_semantic<br/>boost_recency"]
    REP --> RET

    GEN --> POST{Post-answer weak?}
    POST -->|yes once| RET2[One wider semantic re-retrieve]
    RET2 --> GEN2[Regenerate if better]
    POST -->|no| DONE[Answer + retrieved passages<br/>policy, window, sufficiency meta]
    GEN2 --> DONE
    GEN --> POST
